0,Wunambal language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wunambal_language,"The Wunambal language, also known as Northern Worrorran, Gamberre, or Gambera, is a moribund Australian Aboriginal language of Western Australia. It has several dialects, including Yiiji, Gunin, Miwa, and Wilawila (with Gaambera and Wunambal also distinguished as separate). It is spoken by the Wunambal people. Wunambal is one of three Worrorran languages, the others being (Western) Worrorra ...",Wilawila,Australian
